  "notes": "Bootstrap-flavored Electron/desktop look. Sent messages are saturated blue (#168bf9-ish gradient) rounded bubbles with near-white text, aligned right; received messages are off-white (#fcfcfc), barely rounded boxes with a tiny 10px sender name above the text and a right-aligned '11:40 - Nov 18' timestamp. The top bar and message area use very soft gray gradients. Avatars are cartoon illustrations; group rows stack 3–5 circular avatars side by side. Unread conversations show a blue dot overlapping the time and a bold blue snippet. Snippets are cut with ' ...'. Presence is a small green ● 'Active Now' (or 'Last Seen 16:30 - Nov 16') under the header name. The avatar opens a settings dropdown (Seen receipts, notifications, unfollowers, log out)."
